  m_text: '<b>The challenge</b>

    Space Mission Design Game, proposed by the Canadian Space Agency: a game to understand how a space mission is planned and carried out.


    <b>Our project</b>

    You plan an Artemis-style crewed lunar orbit mission: you read the mission, choose and train the crew, buy parts and assemble the rocket, and pick the launch site and date. Then you fly the mission: departure, lunar orbit and return, solving minigames and events.


    <b>The team</b>

    [Team name and the 5 members]'
